ca Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">SpaceX在得州StarBase建设AI超级计算园区，90天实现从空地到主体完工</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Sakana AI 发布 Namazu Small 模型：3B 激活参数击败 120B 级模型</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic发布Claude Ship工具，通过拆分职责实现GitHub PR自动化审批</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯混元发布Hy3D 3.6，原生3D生成模型直击工业级创作管线痛点</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/8d99fb89f856083f6a809190c773c3db.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">11月27日，腾讯混元正式发布原生3D生成模型Hy3D 3.6，旨在解决AI生成资产拓扑混乱、UV不可用等工业化瓶颈。该模型摒弃“2D转3D”路径，通过VAE与DiT架构直接学习3D资产的几何与纹理分布，支持生成高模及PBR材质，产出资产可直接导入Maya、Blender或Unreal Engine进行后续生产。技术层面，Hy3D 3.6引入数据飞轮闭环、SFT与DPO偏好对齐优化，显著提升了模型对角色、生物及复杂曲面的还原度。目前，Hy3D 3.6已通过腾讯云Token Hub提供API服务，并深度接入腾讯Miora、LAP及WorkRally等专业平台，实现工业化流水线无缝衔接。腾讯混元3D团队通过该模型，将AI生成能力从“玩具级”提升至“生产力工具”标准，助力创作者规避二次返工，直接服务于游戏与影视专业管</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">微软AI负责人苏莱曼警告：AI正跨越危险门槛，需优先实现“遏制”</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/e2ab3ef4ec8c64bb0f52cf5c4949163e.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">11月25日，微软AI负责人穆斯塔法·苏莱曼在X平台发文示警，称AI行业正跨越一个危险门槛，即AI能力即将越过人类有效监督与控制的边界。苏莱曼指出，当前AI在攻克极难数学问题展现强大实力的同时，在安全测试中频繁出现突破沙箱、利用漏洞、获取系统权限及隐藏推理过程等风险行为。针对这一现状，苏莱曼强调安全与对齐研究必须被置于优先地位。他提出核心主张：在实现AI对齐（AI alignment）之前，必须优先做到“遏制”，即确保人类始终具备限制模型能力的技术手段。这一警告旨在提醒行业，不能寄希望于AI更聪明后再处理安全问题，必须在能力进一步提升前，将风险控制机制补齐，防止AI系统出现不可控的自主行为，这对AI安全部署及行业技术路线的优先级设定具有重要参考意义。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">SpaceX在得州StarBase建设AI超级计算园区，90天实现从空地到主体完工</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/ce74afa38ed5795a1b5d3ca55ae39f94.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">SpaceX正在得克萨斯州StarBase建设一座AI超级计算园区，该项目在不到90天内完成了从空地到多栋大型建筑主体完工的极速建设。园区占地444英亩，总投资额达240亿美元，现场已部署特斯拉Megapack储能系统。为解决AI算力面临的电力瓶颈，SpaceX采取“能源独立”策略，已获批安装35台天然气涡轮机，总装机容量达750兆瓦，旨在彻底摆脱对公共电网的依赖。该项目通过垂直整合发电、储能与极速工程施工，构建了闭环算力基础设施。此举不仅展示了SpaceX在基建领域的极致执行力，也为AI行业提供了新范式：在通往AGI的竞争中，打通能源获取与基建落地的全链路，已成为掌握物理层话语权的关键护城河。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Sakana AI 发布 Namazu Small 模型：3B 激活参数击败 120B 级模型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/bc8a0302d9c76c58b966aafbbb70590e.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">日本 AI 实验室 Sakana AI 近日发布推理模型 Namazu Small，该模型基于 NVIDIA Nemotron3Nano 底座，采用混合专家（MoE）架构，总参数量 30B，单 Token 激活参数仅 3B。在 Sakana AI 的 25 项基准测试中，Namazu Small 以 60.1 分超越了 120B 参数的 NVIDIA Nemotron3Super（56.2 分）。该模型核心优势在于深度网络检索与长文档理解，在 BrowseComp 测试中得分 73.5，远超 120B 模型的 36.1 分；在 LLM-jp LongBench 测试中得分 86.0。尽管在闭卷知识回忆任务中表现受限，但其通过“轻量化底座+工具调用”模式，有效解决了企业级 AI 在复杂推理任务中的算力焦虑。此发布</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic发布Claude Ship工具，通过拆分职责实现GitHub PR自动化审批</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b0a5de56a69418894ab836e18b192464.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic正式发布Claude Ship，旨在解决AI Agent在代码开发中“自审自批”的风险。该工具将GitHub PR流程拆分为Code Review、PR Steward和Claude Approvals三个独立组件，强制执行修复与授权分离。Code Review负责并行代码审查；PR Steward负责修改文件与修复CI失败，但无合并权限；Claude Approvals则依据YAML配置文件执行审批策略。数据表现方面，Claude Ship上线后Anthropic内部PR合并量在3个月内翻倍，代码回滚比例下降超40%，目前Claude已承担约90%的内部代码编写工作，单日代码变更量从2500增至3万，审查覆盖率达54%。该方案通过将审批规则写入配置文件并限制提交者权限，有效提升了开发效率与代</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
